  "question": {
    "text": "The sum of two forces <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> such that <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>. Find the angle between resultant of <math><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> , ________"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "90",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0082_2394738786de.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 220px;\" /><br />So angle between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is <math><msup><mrow><mn>90</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><br />Alternate solution</p><p><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mtext>P</mtext><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mtext>Q</mtext><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mtext>P</mtext><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0082_8381e2f7018f.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 169px;\" /><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>90</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math></p>"
